    {
      "block_id": "Jwl1dOuYPoaHbzxZXJVcioQhnag",
      "block_type": 2,
      "parent_id": "P9IYdJ3WZo1zxMxFv7NcvITUn8e",
      "text": {
        "elements": [
          {
            "text_run": {
              "content": "MCP（Model Context Protocol，模型上下文协议）是一种开放协议，通过标准化应用向大语言模型提供上下文的方式，让AI模型可以安全地与本地和远程资源进行交互。其核心目标是打破数据孤岛，简化AI模型与外部资源的动态互补，从而提升Agent的实用性和智能化水平。",
              "text_element_style": {
                "bold": false,
                "inline_code": false,
                "italic": false,
                "strikethrough": false,
                "underline": false
              }
            }
          }
        ],
        "style": {
          "align": 1,
          "folded": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "Ev6BdvtQToGi00xonmdcJu3bnQf",
      "block_type": 5,
      "heading3": {
        "elements": [
          {
            "text_run": {
              "content": "相关概念",
              "text_element_style": {
                "bold": false,
                "inline_code": false,
                "italic": false,
                "strikethrough": false,
                "underline": false
              }
            }
          }
        ],
        "style": {
          "align": 1,
          "folded": false
        }
      },
      "parent_id": "P9IYdJ3WZo1zxMxFv7NcvITUn8e"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "HhJgdLG0co2BGHxcrw7cuI1fnEd",
      "block_type": 2,
      "parent_id": "P9IYdJ3WZo1zxMxFv7NcvITUn8e",
      "text": {
        "elements": [
          {
            "text_run": {
              "content": "RAG（Retrieval Augmented Generation，检索增强生成）",
              "text_element_style": {
                "bold": false,
                "inline_code": false,
                "italic": false,
                "strikethrough": false,
                "underline": false
              }
            }
          }
        ],
        "style": {
          "align": 1,
          "folded": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "WyCqdngGJokYXbxOyeCc8fixn3e",
      "block_type": 12,
      "bullet": {
        "elements": [
          {
            "text_run": {
              "content": "不需要训练和微调大模型，只需要提供和用户提问相关的额外的信息到提示词中，从而可以获得更高质量的回答",
              "text_element_style": {
                "bold": false,
                "inline_code": false,
                "italic": false,
                "strikethrough": false,
                "underline": false
              }
            }
          }
        ],
        "style": {
          "align": 1,
          "folded": false
        }
      },
      "parent_id": "P9IYdJ3WZo1zxMxFv7NcvITUn8e"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "NCzUdxhrZocNTVxj5vRc0MtMnHU",
      "block_type": 12,
      "bullet": {
        "elements": [
          {
            "text_run": {
              "content": "通常将资料通过嵌入模型生成服务转化为向量，然后存储到向量数据库中。当用户提问时，将用户的问题向量化从向量数据库中进行相似度匹配出 TOP N 个片段，拼接成新的提示词发送给大模型，大模型就可以结合你的资料更好地回答问题了。",
              "text_element_style": {
                "bold": false,
                "inline_code": false,
                "italic": false,
                "strikethrough": false,
                "underline": false
              }
            }
          }
        ],
        "style": {
          "align": 1,
          "folded": false
        }
      },
      "parent_id": "P9IYdJ3WZo1zxMxFv7NcvITUn8e"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "JF6OdcNWZoZuo2xBVz1cClw6ngf",
      "block_type": 27,
      "image": {
        "align": 2,
        "height": 609,
        "scale": 1,
        "token": "UZ9xb9V4qozdONxlwK5cnpxnnfs",
        "width": 1456
      },
      "parent_id": "P9IYdJ3WZo1zxMxFv7NcvITUn8e"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "GNQbdcCiZoFwWbxK2IQcUy8Tnvc",
      "block_type": 2,
      "parent_id": "P9IYdJ3WZo1zxMxFv7NcvITUn8e",
      "text": {
        "elements": [
          {
            "text_run": {
              "content": "Function Call（函数调用）",
              "text_element_style": {
                "bold": false,
                "inline_code": false,
                "italic": false,
                "strikethrough": false,
                "underline": false
              }
            }
          }
        ],
        "style": {
          "align": 1,
          "folded": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "V3vCdshNuoD1ZRxXxuFcZSWWnsc",
      "block_type": 12,
      "bullet": {
        "elements": [
          {
            "text_run": {
              "content": "是一种允许大型语言模型(LLM)根据用户输入识别它需要的工具并决定何时调用该工具的机制。",
              "text_element_style": {
                "bold": false,
                "inline_code": false,
                "italic": false,
                "strikethrough": false,
                "underline": false
              }
            }
          }
        ],
        "style": {
          "align": 1,
          "folded": false
        }
      },
      "parent_id": "P9IYdJ3WZo1zxMxFv7NcvITUn8e"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "QrCadSxAiom2u5xtNH4c41lPnmd",
      "block_type": 12,
      "bullet": {
        "elements": [
          {
            "text_run": {
              "content": "基本工作原理如下：LLM 接收用户的提示词，LLM 决定它需要的工具，执行方法调用，后端服务执行实际的请求给出处理结果，大语言模型根据处理结果生成最终给用户的回答。",
              "text_element_style": {
                "bold": false,
                "inline_code": false,
                "italic": false,
                "strikethrough": false,
                "underline": false
              }
            }
          }
        ],
        "style": {
          "align": 1,
          "folded": false
        }
      },
      "parent_id": "P9IYdJ3WZo1zxMxFv7NcvITUn8e"
    },
